## Difference between list and tuple

# List

##1. The boundary of list is []
##2. The list are mutable
##3. We can store the single element in the list
##4. It is having variable length memory allocation
##5. It is less secured

# Tuple

##1. The boundary of tuple is ()
##2. Tuples are immutable
##3. We can store the single element ,but we must have a comma for it
##4. It is having a fixed length memory allocation
##5. It is more secured
